keyrad is a Go-based RADIUS server that authenticates users against Keycloak,
supporting password and OTP (TOTP) flows with challenge-response.

This package installs the keyrad daemon binary (/usr/local/bin/keyrad). On
OPNsense it is driven by the os-keyrad GUI plugin (Services > keyrad RADIUS),
which generates the configuration and manages the service. The binary can also
be run standalone with -c <config.yaml> -r <clients.conf>.
